Cell["\<\
From theory, we know that the derivative of even coordinates are 0. We set it \
from the start, to simplify computations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellGroupingRules->{"GroupTogetherGrouping", 10000.},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9932043831708393`*^9, 3.9932044227039967`*^9}, 
   3.99475412748942*^9, 3.9947557296562176`*^9, {3.9947560609495964`*^9, 
