Cell["\<\
Build the generating object of the continuous hierarchy. 
Expand the lattice parameters in L\
\>", "Text",
 CellGroupingRules->{"GroupTogetherGrouping", 10001.},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9932036098306713`*^9, 3.993203645287781*^9}, 
   3.9932042538467064`*^9, 3.9947557296562176`*^9, {3.994756060959215*^9, 
   3.9947560679098434`*^9}, 3.994756189917406*^9, {3.9956035244742393`*^9, 
